('mz.en_IN.rainmaker-common.BPA_FAQ_ANS_THREE','en_IN','BPA_FAQ_ANS_THREE','The eDCR scrutiny system compares the parameters in the drawings against the by laws set in the corresponding administrative region and evaluates if they are violating. In the output file, against each paramter that is evaluated, there will be an indication to show if that is approved or rejected. The entire scrutiny process takes ~5 seconds','mz','rainmaker-common',0,now(),0,now()),
